$$
\begin{aligned}
&2\left(1-2\sin^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{9}\right)\right)^2-1\\&\qquad=2\cos^2\left(\frac{4\pi}{9}\right)-1\\&\qquad=\cos\left(\frac{8\pi}{9}\right)
